82
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,933
Hancurkan benteng!

83
00:03:32,900 --> 00:03:34,433
Ada panah silang, cepat sembunyi!

84
00:03:35,566 --> 00:03:36,866
Tarik kembali mesin pelontar!

85
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:37,366
